            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ifWr28iOIdaJijAMA"><p>Keep the Ritual, Lose the Harm 🤲</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i3U5aeaok3hi6A3Yi"
              ><p>Replacements to quit like patches or gum often fail because they ignore the psychological habit: the hand-to-mouth gesture. Lio is weighted to feel exactly like a premium device between your fingers. Keep your social ritual at the café, in the car, or at the office, <strong>while eliminating 100% of nicotine and combustion.</strong></p></div
            ></div
